{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50269","headline":"览链师张殷儒诗 · 李翔","name":"览链师张殷儒诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石井峰高劈曙云，云开山露见张君。\n心藏定远握中策，袖贮怀沙江上文。\n巨壑波翻鲸少敌，老松巢迥鹤难羣。\n无端示我青霞句，吟断秋风到日曛。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}